Bath & Beyond this week and all of a sudden I hear Angela and I turn around and it's Phil Shea and he has three different types of woven gray blankets that he's holding.
Bath & Beyond 购物时，突然听到有人叫安吉拉，我一回头，发现是菲尔·谢伊，他手里正拿着三种不同款式的灰色编织毯。

636
00:30:40.990 --> 00:30:41.710
