Like, you guys have all the cool onset stories about, you know, the time that the heater fell over and started a fire and, you know, whatever it is.
就像你们有所有那些很酷的片场故事，比如暖气倒下引发火灾什么的，不管是什么。

733
00:35:13.050 --> 00:35:14.590
We don't have any of those cool stories.
我们没有任何那种酷故事。

734
00:35:14.690 --> 00:35:16.630
So it all has to be like, where did you come up with that?
所以一切都得是，你是怎么想出那个点子的？

735
00:35:16.850 --> 00:35:17.590
I love it.
