00:53:44.510 --> 00:53:47.790
names for what Toby's brother's name would be.
托比的兄弟该叫什么名字。

1113
00:53:48.210 --> 00:53:54.510
And at the time, I had been going through old photos of, like, my theater days, and there
当时，我正在翻看我以前演戏时的旧照片，照片里

