There's always one person in a theater group, you know?
剧团里总有这么一个人，你懂的吧？

1116
00:54:01.910 --> 00:54:04.070
And I was like, the name Rory!
我就说，罗里这个名字！

1117
00:54:04.250 --> 00:54:05.990
You've got to use the name Rory!
你们一定要用罗里这个名字！

1118
00:54:06.150 --> 00:54:07.550
Put that name on the list!
把这个名字写进名单里！

1119
00:54:08.190 --> 00:54:08.370
Yeah.
没错。

1120
00:54:08.590 --> 00:54:13.690
I always wonder, like, I don't know who ended up voting, but I made sure Rory got on the liSt.
我一直很好奇，不知道最后是谁投票决定的，但我确保了罗里上了名单。

1121
00:54:14.650 --> 00:54:17.530
Rory's a great name for that character, too.
罗里这个名字对那个角色来说也很棒。

1122
00:54:17.690 --> 00:54:21.070
It's sort of like the rural juror on 30 Rockets.
就像《我为喜剧狂》里的“乡村陪审员”一样。

1123
00:54:21.070 --> 00:54:21.330
Yes.
是的。

1124
00:54:21.790 --> 00:54:25.410
It's just a really weak, soft sort of sound.
听起来就是一种非常无力、柔和的声音。

1125
00:54:25.410 --> 00:54:26.310
It's a hard name to say.
这是一个很难发音的名字。

1126
00:54:26.610 --> 00:54:26.730
It's hard.
很难。

1127
00:54:26.830 --> 00:54:27.590
It's hard to say.
很难发音。

1128
00:54:27.950 --> 00:54:30.150
Combined with Flenderson, it just sounds great.
加上弗伦德森这个姓，听起来真是太棒了。

1129
00:54:30.230 --> 00:54:30.810
Rory Flenderson.
罗里·弗伦德森。

1130
00:54:30.810 --> 00:54:35.210
You really get a sense of their parents and the name choice for their sons.
你真的能感受到他们的父母在给儿子起名时的那种感觉。

1131
00:54:35.630 --> 00:54:36.170
Toby and Rory.
托比和罗里。

1132
00:54:36.730 --> 00:54:39.570
And Rory's got some kind of bizarre fascination with jaMs.
而且罗里对果酱有一种奇怪的迷恋。

1133
00:54:39.730 --> 00:54:43.350
You just, that's the, you know, that's one of the possible spinoffs.
你懂的，这就是其中一个可能的衍生剧方向。

1134
00:54:43.450 --> 00:54:44.590
Yes, exactly.
是的，没错。

1135
00:54:44.950 --> 00:54:45.290
Exactly.
确实。

1136
00:54:45.710 --> 00:54:46.630
Jamming with Rory.
与罗里一起做果酱。

1137
00:54:46.710 --> 00:54:49.050
It's Michael and Rory in Colorado.
那是迈克尔和罗里在科罗拉多州的故事。

1138
00:54:49.610 --> 00:54:53.910
Well, I reached out to Warren about this, and he told me, I'm going to quote him.
我联系了沃伦询问此事，他告诉我，我要引用他的话。

1139
00:54:54.030 --> 00:54:58.550
He said, it came down between me and Steve Buscemi to play Toby's brother.
他说，当时在我和史蒂夫·布西密之间选人来演托比的兄弟。

1140
00:54:58.550 --> 00:55:00.950
But Steve was considered too handsome.
但史蒂夫被认为太帅了。

1141
00:55:01.210 --> 00:55:01.490
Ha ha.
哈哈。

1142
00:55:03.590 --> 00:55:07.190
And then he said, this little scene was a ton of fun to be in.
然后他说，拍这个小场景非常有趣。

1143
00:55:07.350 --> 00:55:08.830
They shot it maybe six times.
他们大概拍了六次。

1144
00:55:08.990 --> 00:55:11.810
And after the second take, Paul Fee came up and said, it's great.
拍完第二条后，保罗·费格走过来说，演得很好。

1145
00:55:11.970 --> 00:55:14.870
But could I please mumble a little bit more like Toby?
但能不能请我再多嘟囔一点，像托比那样？

1146
00:55:15.690 --> 00:55:20.050
Then after the next take, again, same note, could I please mumble more?
然后拍下一条后，还是同样的建议，能不能请我再多嘟囔一点？

1147
00:55:20.350 --> 00:55:24.670
So the next take, I really went for it and mumbled so hard that I could barely understand
所以拍下一条时，我真的豁出去了，嘟囔得太厉害，以至于我几乎听不清

1148
00:55:24.670 --> 00:55:26.370
the words coming out of my own mouth.
自己嘴里说出来的话。

1149
00:55:26.870 --> 00:55:31.210
After that shot, I apologized because I thought it was ridiculous, probably, and just a bunch
拍完那条后，我道了歉，因为我觉得这太荒谬了，可能

1150
00:55:31.210 --> 00:55:31.730
of gibberish.
只是一堆胡言乱语。

1151
00:55:31.890 --> 00:55:33.830
And Paul Fee said, no, it was perfect.
保罗·费格说，不，这很完美。

1152
00:55:34.210 --> 00:55:37.570
And if I could try to mumble even a bit more, you know, like Toby.
如果我能试着再含糊不清一点，你知道，就像托比那样。

1153
00:55:37.570 --> 00:55:42.710
And Warren said, I think it wasn't really until that point that I truly appreciated my
沃伦说，我想直到那一刻，我才真正意识到我的

1154
00:55:42.710 --> 00:55:44.290
brother was a mumbling genius.
哥哥是个含糊不清的天才。

1155
00:55:47.270 --> 00:55:53.750
We had a fan catch from Nevada D in Boulder, Colorado, who said, background catch.
我们收到了一位来自科罗拉多州博尔德市的粉丝内华达·D的投稿，他说，背景里有个小发现。

1156
00:55:53.930 --> 00:55:57.670
I've been holding onto this one for a while now, and I am so excited to share.
我把这个留了很久了，现在非常激动能分享出来。

1157
00:55:57.970 --> 00:56:02.490
In this episode, we see Toby video chatting with his brother, Rory, who lives in Boulder,
在这一集中，我们看到托比正在和他的哥哥罗里视频聊天，罗里住在科罗拉多州的博尔德市，

1158
00:56:02.490 --> 00:56:09.450
Colorado, the view through Rory's window is of the Chautauqua National Historical Landmark
透过罗里的窗户可以看到肖托夸国家历史地标，

1159
00:56:09.450 --> 00:56:11.230
or the Flatirons.
或者说弗拉特隆山。

1160
00:56:11.550 --> 00:56:17.130
Based on this view, Rory Flunderson lives on Baseline Road in Boulder, and that would mean
根据这个视野，罗里·弗兰德森住在博尔德的基线路上，这意味着

1161
00:56:17.130 --> 00:56:19.990
that he's rather wealthy for living in that part of town.
他能住在城里的那个地段，相当富有。

1162
